variant StandUserVector
name Stand User Vector
from CauldronExperimental ExtraVillainVariants
base Vector
challenge Silent Plague
At the start of the game, put Supervirus under Vector. It does not count as being in play.
The first time Vector would be destroyed each game, instead set him to 10 HP and put Supervirus from under him into play.

